      "expr": "05-tearsmile",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "芷君看著他。咖啡涼了。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "後來的貝澳，凌晨沒有去。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
